  "body_html": "<h1>IsCompletelyMixedWithPositiveReach.reach_pos</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem IsCompletelyMixedWithPositiveReach.reach_pos {G : ExtensiveGame iota U} [DecidableEq G.State] [(s : G.State) -&gt; Fintype (G.Action s)] {beta : G.BehaviorProfile} {fuel : Nat} (hbeta : IsCompletelyMixedWithPositiveReach beta fuel) (root : G.State) : 0 &lt; reachProb G beta root fuel</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BehaviorProfile</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixedWithPositiveReach</li>\n<li>isEmpty</li>\n<li>actionProb</li>\n<li>IsReachable.next</li>\n<li>expectedPayoff</li>\n<li>ReachedSubgamePayoffTransfer.init</li>\n</ul>",
